{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38533","headline":"坤维军前寄江南弟兄 · 吴融","name":"坤维军前寄江南弟兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二年征战劒山秋，家在松江白浪头。\n关月几时乾客泪，戍烟终日起乡愁。\n未知辽堞何当下，转觉燕台不易酬。\n独羡一声南去雁，满天风雨到汀洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}